  "body": "Post-merge run 44030818968 on `feabe2524` (merge of PR #2013) is red.\nThe run before it (`f887908f9`) was green.\n\nFailure: `cl suites: headless_bin  failed: [tests: cl_bin_prints_move_stats]`.\n\nCause: PR #2013 regenerated `crates/app/tests/golden/contour_disc_hole.cl`.\nThe golden lost its air-level passes (69 moves became 46).\nThe test in `crates/cl/tests/headless_bin.rs` still expects 69 moves.\nThis is an out-of-date test expectation, not wrong output.\n\nDone means: the batch tier is green on main.\n",
